From: DuDuClaw OS Y6-1 (2026-08-26)
Subject: fix INSTALL_INTERFACE include dirs to be sysroot-relative, not baked absolute

Real CMake Generate-step failure hit consuming Fcitx5::Core from
fcitx5-chewing's cross-compiled build: "Imported target 'Fcitx5::Core'
includes non-existent path '/usr/include/Fcitx5/Core' in its
INTERFACE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES" -- CMake checks that
$<INSTALL_INTERFACE:...> paths exist as part of generating a consumer's
build files, and CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_INCLUDEDIR is already an ABSOLUTE path
baked in at fcitx5's OWN configure time (correct from that build's own
host-filesystem view, meaningless/nonexistent from a DIFFERENT recipe's
--sysroot cross-compile). CMAKE_INSTALL_INCLUDEDIR (relative, e.g. "include")
is what CMake's own INSTALL_INTERFACE machinery is designed to combine with
the *consuming* project's install prefix at import time -- using the
relative form is the documented, portable way to write this, not a
sysroot-specific hack.

This exact three-file fix (fcitx-config/fcitx-utils/fcitx CMakeLists.txt)
matches a real, independently-authored community fix already carried by
the hyyoxhk/meta-fcitx5 Yocto layer (its own
"0002-Use-CMAKE_INSTALL_INCLUDEDIR-instead-of-CMAKE_INSTAL...patch",
dated 2021, Upstream-Status: Pending against fcitx/fcitx5 upstream) --
confirms this is a known, recurring fcitx5 cross-compile gap and not
something invented for this recipe; verified the pattern is still present
unchanged in fcitx5 5.1.12's actual source before adapting it here (line
numbers shifted slightly since 2021, content did not).

Upstream-Status: Pending [not yet submitted to fcitx/fcitx5]
Signed-off-by: DuDuClaw OS Y6-1

--- a/src/lib/fcitx-config/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/lib/fcitx-config/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -37,7 +37,7 @@
 target_include_directories(Fcitx5Config PUBLIC
     $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/..>
     $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/..>
-    $<INSTALL_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_INCLUDEDIR}/Fcitx5/Config>)
+    $<INSTALL_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_INSTALL_INCLUDEDIR}/Fcitx5/Config>)
 target_link_libraries(Fcitx5Config PUBLIC Fcitx5::Utils)
 
 configure_file(Fcitx5Config.pc.in ${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/Fcitx5Config.pc @ONLY)
--- a/src/lib/fcitx-utils/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/lib/fcitx-utils/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -128,7 +128,7 @@
 target_include_directories(Fcitx5Utils PUBLIC
     $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/..>
     $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/..>
-    $<INSTALL_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_INCLUDEDIR}/Fcitx5/Utils>)
+    $<INSTALL_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_INSTALL_INCLUDEDIR}/Fcitx5/Utils>)
 target_link_libraries(Fcitx5Utils PRIVATE DL::DL LibIntl::LibIntl Pthread::Pthread ${FMT_TARGET})
 if(LIBKVM_FOUND)
     target_link_libraries(Fcitx5Utils PRIVATE LibKVM::LibKVM)
--- a/src/lib/fcitx/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/lib/fcitx/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -74,7 +74,7 @@
 target_include_directories(Fcitx5Core PUBLIC
     $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/..>
     $<BUILD_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/..>
-    $<INSTALL_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_INSTALL_FULL_INCLUDEDIR}/Fcitx5/Core>)
+    $<INSTALL_INTERFACE:${CMAKE_INSTALL_INCLUDEDIR}/Fcitx5/Core>)
 target_link_libraries(Fcitx5Core PUBLIC Fcitx5::Config Fcitx5::Utils PRIVATE LibIntl::LibIntl ${FMT_TARGET})
 if (ENABLE_KEYBOARD)
     target_link_libraries(Fcitx5Core PRIVATE XKBCommon::XKBCommon)
